  "content": "<h2>创造更多座位</h2>\n<p>也请看看我的其他模组：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-trainutilities\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create 列车工具</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-train-lights\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create 列车灯光</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3b54ad5c623f7d9152857979f2b729e46bf43037_0.webp\" alt=\"title\"></p>\n<p>为列车和机械装置添加两种现代座椅的模组。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/DkcprwueFj\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://discord.com/api/guilds/1248636479627071488/widget.png?style=banner2\" alt=\"discord\"></a></p>\n<h2>依赖项</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a> / <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Fabric</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252farchitectury-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Architectury API</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>功能特性</h2>\n<h3>座椅使用示例</h3>\n<div style=\"display:flex\"><img width=\"49.5%\" height=\"auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/cec1b695a56c8ae174b68c82aff1ebda727d2de2.png\" alt=\"img_one\"> <img style=\"margin-left:20px\" width=\"49.5%\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e06f8c60af5519be8dd65913c929ae865858459b.png\" alt=\"img_two\"></div>\n<h3>所有变体</h3>\n<div style=\"display:flex\"><img width=\"49.5%\" height=\"auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/73ec3efae79847b5485f99d860f7e114a8de746d.png\" alt=\"img_one\"> <img style=\"margin-left:20px\" width=\"49.5%\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/46b17ae41b62bd030493ea26dd8349e3049e1434.png\" alt=\"img_two\"></div>\n<h3>更多功能</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>可用于列车</li>\n<li>可染色</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>语言支持</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>英语</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>重要提示！</h2>\n<p>在安装模组更新之前，您应始终备份您的世界，以防止世界数据受损。</p>\n<h2>支持我</h2>\n<p>如果您想支持我和我的工作，请访问我的 Ko-fi 页面 ❤️</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fadeptstack_programmerlp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ko-fi</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>致谢</h2>\n<p>感谢 Vinicius M 负责视觉设计工作 :)</p>",
